SUMMARY:Algonquin Voyageur Canoe Paddle
DESCRIPTION:Wilderness Union Toronto - Outdoor Adventure and Hiking Club\n
 **Please note the only way to register for this adventure is on [our websi
 te.](https://www.wildernessunion.com/adventures/voyageur-paddle)**\n\n**Pr
 epare for a truly unique paddling adventure\, as you take on a beautiful r
 oute in two epic voyageur canoes.**\n\nAdapted from traditional canoes des
 igned by Indigenous communities\, these 10-person voyageur canoes were use
 d for many years to carry people and supplies. Now\, you’ll get the oppo
 rtunity with a full crew to try your luck at navigating these vessels thro
 ugh the beautiful waters of Algonquin.\n\nWe'll meet at Algonquin Outfitte
 rs on Oxtongue Lake to begin our journey...\n\nYou’ll be split into two 
 canoes and follow a winding\, 15km route down the lake and onto the river.
  Be sure to watch the shoreline for dense pines and the odd cottage tucked
  into the trees. Getting a big canoe to move well takes real teamwork\, an
 d with two crews on the water\, don't be surprised if the paddle turns int
 o a friendly race. It's a full day on the water with the people beside you
 \, calling out strokes\, laughing at whoever falls out of rhythm\, and fig
 uring out together how to steer 8 metres of canoe.\n\n**Accessibility**\nW
 ilderness Union is committed to making our adventures as accessible as pos
 sible. If you wish to make an accommodation request relating to a disabili
 ty or provide feedback\, please do so by sending an email to info@wilderne
 ssunion.com\n\n**Highlights**\n**The Voyageur Canoe: **An 8 metre canoe pa
 ddled by a full crew instead of a pair.\n**Sandy Beaches:** Discover lakes
 ide sandy beaches contrasting the granite cliffs.\n**Oxtongue Lake: **Sand
 y shoreline and clear water at the doorstep of Algonquin Park\n\n**Event c
 ost: $110+HST (for explorer members) + $60 optional transport available.**
 \n**Register [here.](https://www.wildernessunion.com/adventures/voyageur-p
 addle)**\n\n**About Wilderness Union**\nWilderness Union is deliberate abo
 ut building an outdoors community that connects you to the life-changing m
 agic of the outdoors and helps you find your people.\n\nMembers range from
  20-40 years old. The group is a mix of GTA locals and newcomers to Toront
 o from within Canada and abroad.\n\nAttendance numbers on Meetup don't ref
 lect our actual event attendance - we typically have 15-20 community membe
 rs at each event. Large enough that there's someone new to meet but small 
 enough that it's not overwhelming!\n\n***Learn more at our website [www.wi
 ldernessunion.com](https://www.wildernessunion.com/)***
